    <item>
      <title>Anton Osika：从Spotify工程师到AI独角兽掌舵者，一位“反脆弱”组织的构建者</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/anton-osikaspotifyai-20250903074004873-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 03 Sep 2025 07:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
